Package: fancygam
Title: Increased Flexibility For Plotting GAMs
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Camille", "Ross", email = "camille.ross@maine.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-1428-2294"))
Description: This package provides increased flexibility when plotting GAMs, including improved options for representing the data rugs, control over individual smooths, and the option to plot factor-smooth interactions alongside one another.
